            Requirements (from core-task-briefs-2026-11-12.md), each red first

            - **L-1.** latest: Idle mints; a never-sent head (Acknowledging, Unsent) is superseded as evidence and the 
              newer
              commit promotes; every other phase queues the newer commit, ending a queued one Superseded; a head with a
              pending cancel (Withdrawing) is never superseded (WriteLanes `algorithm` `cell`; WriteLanes R7, R14). 
